{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 8, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a journey to the land of the rising sun a most wondrous quest I shall now weave for thee.\n\n**Day First Arrival in Tokyo a Metropolis of Light**\n\nFrom distant shores thou shalt arrive at Narita's gate.\nA taxi swift shall bear thee to thy lodging state.\nShinjuku's towers a dazzling sight they be.\nA feast of ramen a culinary spree.\nThen wander through Shinjuku Gyoen's green grace.\nA peaceful respite in this bustling place.\n\n**Day Second Tokyo's Ancient Heart**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple a journey we take.\nSenso-ji's grandeur for goodness sake.\nNakamise-dori's stalls a vibrant throng.\nWith trinkets and treats where joys belong.\nThen Ueno Park a haven serene and wide.\nMuseums and gardens where memories reside.\nIn Akihabara's realm of electric dreams.\nExplore the gadgets and anime streams.\n\n**Day Third Hakone's Volcanic Beauty**\n\nA mountain escape to Hakone we fly.\nLake Ashi's waters reflecting the sky.\nA cruise upon the lake a tranquil scene.\nMount Fuji's majesty forever keen.\nThe Hakone Open-Air Museum a wondrous art.\nSculptures and nature playing a vital part.\nOnsen's warmth a soothing delight.\nBathing in waters pure and bright.\n\n**Day Fourth Kyoto's Imperial Splendor**\n\nBy bullet train we speed to Kyoto's keep.\nWhere ancient traditions slumber deep.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermillion maze.\nA thousand torii in a sunlit haze.\nKiyomizu-dera's temple a wooden grace.\nPanoramic views of this hallowed place.\nGion's district where geishas softly tread.\nA glimpse of old Japan a vision spread.\n\n**Day Fifth Kyoto's Golden Pavilion**\n\nKinkaku-ji's splendor a gilded dream.\nThe Golden Pavilion by the waters gleam.\nRyoan-ji's garden a zenful art.\nFifteen stones a peaceful restart.\nArashiyama Bamboo Grove a verdant maze.\nSunlight filtering in a hazy daze.\nNijo Castle where shoguns held their sway.\nA testament to power come what may.\n\n**Day Sixth Nara's Deer and Temples**\n\nTo Nara we journey with joyful pace.\nTodai-ji's Great Buddha a sacred space.\nFriendly deer roam freely in Nara Park.\nA gentle encounter a wondrous mark.\nKasuga Taisha Shrine lanterns glow.\nA path to blessings where spirits flow.\nReturn to Kyoto for a final night.\nReflecting on wonders bathed in light.\n\n**Day Seventh Farewell Japan**\n\nFrom Kansai Airport we bid farewell.\nTo this land of beauty where stories dwell.\nMemories gathered treasures to hold dear.\nUntil we meet again my friend so clear.\nMay thy journey be blessed thy spirit free.\nAnd Japan's enchantment ever with thee.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.011765611357986927}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.49480628967285156}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.9568174481391907}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.0011333954753354192}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.07314319163560867}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": -1.4778335094451904}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.2979184687137604}, {"token": "▁rising", "logprob": -0.088943712413311}, {"token": "▁sun", "logprob": -0.00019107422849629074}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.09246736019849777}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.12191765755414963}, {"token": "▁wondrous", "logprob": -0.0402863435447216}, {"token": "▁quest", "logprob": -0.34371986985206604}, {"token": "▁I", "logprob": -0.3055385649204254}, {"token": "▁shall", "logprob": -0.007747837342321873}, {"token": "▁now", "logprob": -0.45270317792892456}, {"token": "▁weave", "logprob": -0.3054332733154297}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.0035006452817469835}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.0019528857665136456}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.09186312556266785}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.0020425901748239994}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -8.34461570775602e-06}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.00335463834926486}, {"token": "▁Firs